PPG-Bench encoder sources

PaPaGei: https://github.com/Nokia-Bell-Labs/papagei-foundation-model
  papagei_net.py; BSD-3-Clause license below.
PulsePPG: https://github.com/maxxu05/pulseppg
  pulseppg_net.py; MIT license below.

AnyPPG (https://github.com/Ngk03/AnyPPG) and SigmaPPG
(https://github.com/ZonghengGuo/SigmaPPG) implementations are not distributed
with PPG-Bench. Users must obtain their source and checkpoints directly from the
authors. anyppg.py and sigmappg.py are PPG-Bench integration adapters that
load these external implementations.

MOMENT (https://github.com/moment-timeseries-foundation-model/moment) is
provided by the separately installed momentfm package. moment.py is the
PPG-Bench adapter. PRVCtrl is implemented by PPG-Bench in prv.py.

